//RS //! comptime/interpreter tier `include!` the same file, and every other tier is
//RS //! a marshalling adapter. A second implementation — compensated or naive —
//RS //! makes one tier answer a question differently from the rest, which is the
//RS //! exact I9 drift this card removed.
